OL,3,GNEWSAPolice destruction of miner strike
OL,4,Afiles likely to be examined
OL,5,
OL,6,FA public inquiry is likely to
OL,7,Finvestigate whether a police force's
OL,8,Fdestruction of documents related to the
OL,9,Fminers' strike was legal or not.
OL,11,FInformation about the so-called Battle
OL,12,Fof Orgreave was said to be among two
OL,13,Fboxes disposed of by Northumbria Police
OL,14,Fin April 2024, which the force later
OL,15,Finvestigated. However, the force
OL,16,Fdeclined to release its findings due to
OL,17,Fthe opening of the The Orgreave
OL,18,FInquiry.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
