OL,3,GNEWSAPolice destruction of miner strike
OL,4,Afiles likely to be examined
OL,5,
OL,6,FA list of provisional issues the
OL,7,Finquiry says it wants to clarify
OL,8,Fincludes the extent to which evidence
OL,9,Fabout Orgreave is "no longer
OL,10,Favailable".
OL,12,FThe Orgreave Truth and Justice Campaign
OL,13,Fsecretary Kate Flannery said she did
OL,14,Fnot understand the police force's
OL,15,Fdecision to not release its findings.
